      "message": "As in C++ exceptions? I don\u0027t think you can do that at a stable API boundary, because the C++ ABI is not stable. It\u0027s never come up before so we don\u0027t have an explicit rule against it, but the initial reaction from API council is that this isn\u0027t viable. (http://cl/675302191 adds explicit language to the docs)\n\nReturn error codes if there\u0027s anything the caller can do about them (go/android-ndk-api-guidelines#error-handling) and document them (go/android-ndk-api-guidelines#well-documented)",
