      "side": 1,
      "message": "I assume there\u0027s a good reason but I do have to ask: does this actually need the complicated callback structure rather than simply `ARpc_addAccessor`? The double indirection here is a little surprising. This API registers a provider for a function which itself provides an accessor? Is `RegisterThingProviderProvider` really the right API?",
